        "subtitle": "JIANG CHENGYAN",
        "descriptionLine1": "LIGHTING / TECH ART / GAME DESIGN",
        "descriptionLine2": "从灯光氛围到工具管线，我更习惯直接动手解决让团队卡住的问题。",
        "ctaLabel": "进入全部作品",
